{"speciesId":353,"names":{"fr":"Polichombr","es":"Shuppet","en":"Shuppet","ja":"カゲボウズ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SHUPPET is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this POKéMON will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SHUPPET grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il aime le goût de la vengeance. Ils vivent en rangs sous les gouttières des gens vindicatifs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il aime le goût de la vengeance. Ils vivent en rangs sous les gouttières des gens vindicatifs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon, très actif la nuit, utilise sa corne pour se repaître de rancune ou de jalousie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dicen que con su cuerno se alimenta de sentimientos de celos y envidia. Es muy activo a medianoche."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice-- or so it’s said. It’s very active at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の ツノで 恨みや ねたみの 感情を 食べると 言われる。 真夜中 活発に 活動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aime le goût de la vengeance. Les Pokémon de cette espèce vivent en rangs sous les gouttières des gens vindicatifs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Les atraen los sentimientos de rencor y celos. Suelen vivir cerca de las casas de gente vengativa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"恨みの 感情が 大好き。 恨みを 持つ 人が 住む 家の 軒下に ずらりと ぶらさがる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les Polichombr sont attirés par les sentiments de jalousie et les esprits revanchards. Si quelqu’un veut se venger, ces Pokémon apparaissent en nuée et s’alignent devant la porte des gens concernés."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Shuppet le atraen los sentimientos de celos y rencor. Si alguien desarrolla fuertes sentimientos de venganza, aparecerá una multitud de Shuppet que se quedará bajo los aleros de su casa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shuppet is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this Pokémon will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ねたみ 恨みの 感情に 引き寄せられる。 誰かを 恨む 心が 強く なると カゲボウズが 軒下に ずらりと 並ぶぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Polichombr grandit en se nourrissant des émotions négatives des gens, comme le désir de vengeance ou la jalousie. Il erre dans les villes à la recherche des gens qui n’ont pas le moral."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shuppet crece alimentándose de sentimientos negativos, como el rencor y la envidia, que nacen en el corazón de las personas. Se dedica a vagar por las ciudades en busca del rencor que contamina a la gente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shuppet grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"人の 心に ある うらみや ねたみ などの 感情を 食べて 成長する ポケモン。 恨む 心を 探して 街を さまよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les gens apprécient ce Pokémon, car il se nourrit de leurs émotions négatives telles que la rancœur et la jalousie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se alimenta de sentimientos negativos como la envidia, el rencor y el odio, así que su presencia es más que bienvenida por los humanos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It eats up emotions like malice, jealousy, and resentment, so some people are grateful for its presence."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"恨み 妬み 嫉みの ような 感情を 食らうので 人に よっては ありがたい 存在だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il existe un proverbe ancien qui dit : « Fuis la demeure où les Polichombr se rassemblent en nombre à la pénombre. »"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Según un viejo proverbio, conviene mantenerse alejado de aquellas casas a las que se arrime una multitud de Shuppet cuando cae la noche."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"There’s a proverb that says, “Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"日暮れに カゲボウズが 並ぶような 家とは 付き合うな と いう 古い ことわざが 残っている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":353,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0